cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you follow or reuse this transfer guide, please cite it as below."
title: "Getting data in and out of S4P — tutorial and preflight checks"
abstract: >-
  A step-by-step guide to moving data between a researcher's machine and the
  HIFIS/PUNCH dCache instance at DESY, paired with a runnable preflight that
  tests each prerequisite separately — DNS, TCP reach, WebDAV method set,
  token validity and effective VO authorisation — so a blocked upload names
  its own cause. Includes the reverse direction: a one-step workflow addition
  that publishes a REANA run's results back to S4P under a run-traceable path.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - research data management
  - dCache
  - WebDAV
  - Helmholtz AAI
  - PUNCH4NFDI
  - data transfer
authors:
  - name: "PhysicsLLM C.5, Deutsches Elektronen-Synchrotron DESY"
    website: "https://physics-llm.erumdatahub.de/"
